 style=\"top: 90px;\">小红书: 小许要开花</span>\n  <span class=\"watermark\" style=\"top: 250px;\">小红书: 小许要开花</span>\n  <span class=\"watermark\" style=\"top: 400px;\">小红书: 小许要开花</span>\n  <span class=\"watermark\" style=\"top: 550px;\">小红书: 小许要开花</span>\n  <span class=\"watermark\" style=\"top: 640px;\">小红书: 小许要开花</span>\n\n  <div class=\"title-box\">四、类比推理</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"num-circle\">1</span>语义关系</div>\n  <div class=\"indent-line\">①近反义词②比喻象征</div>\n  <div class=\"indent-line\">③谦词，敬词，语体色彩〈褒义词，贬义词〉</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\"><span class=\"num-circle\">2</span>逻辑关系</div>\n  <div class=\"indent-line\">①并列关系②矛盾关系（非此即彼）③反对关系（存在小三）</div>\n  <div class=\"hand-note\">\n    <span class=\"hand-icon\">☝️</span>二级辨析：同一范畴\n    <span class=\"second-item\">并列+对应考察</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\"><span class=\"num-circle\">3</span>包容关系</div>\n  <div class=\"indent-line\">种属：①…是…　②特指</div>\n  <div class=\"indent-line\">③…不是…</div>\n  <div class=\"indent-line\">④主要/次要，必然/或然　组成：零部件</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\"><span class=\"num-circle\">4</span>交叉关系:</div>\n  <div class=\"indent-line\">从不同角度描述同一事物，有交集，用有的是有的不是造句</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\"><span class=\"num-circle\">5</span>对应关系</div>\n  <div class=\"indent-line\">1.材料</div>\n  <div class=\"indent-line\">2.工艺，二级辨析：物理化学变化，是否有新生物质生成</div>\n  <div class=\"indent-line\">3.功能：主要/次要</div>\n  <div class=\"indent-line\">4.属性：必然/或然</div>\n  <div class=\"indent-line\">5.时间顺序</div>\n  <div class=\"hand-note\">\n    <span class=\"hand-icon\">☝️</span>二级辨析：行为发出主体\n    <span class=\"second-item\">必要条件、因果</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\"><span class=\"num-circle\">5</span>语法关系</div>\n  <div class=\"indent-line\">主谓/主宾/动宾</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
